# name|caveat shown by scripts/check-updates.sh when an update is available.
# Keep these generic (no company values). Add a row when you learn a downside the hard way.
neovim|Config (kickstart.nvim) and plugins can break on new minor releases; open nvim and run :checkhealth afterwards.
tree-sitter|Can change grammar/parser ABI; neovim treesitter parsers may need reinstalling (:TSUpdate). Release publishes no digest, so the hash is computed locally.
yazi|Config/plugin format changes between releases; `yazi` and `ya` must be updated together (both are linked from one archive).
resvg|Rendering output can change slightly; yazi SVG previews depend on it.
imagemagick|AppImage is extracted (about 100 MB+ per version); policy/format defaults can change between versions.
ffmpeg|Large dependency set; yazi video previews rely on it.
